{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nThe Rhine is broad tonight, and the air in Cologne is thick with the scent of the evening. I write from the inn, weary but content.\n\nIn Aachen, I spent hours in the cathedral, sitting in the very chair where Charlemagne was crowned. There is a weight to such history that no book can convey. I also spent a long day viewing Bettendorf’s paintings, the man himself present, discussing the works with great passion. It was a good use of time, though I confess my legs ached by the end of the afternoon.\n\nI took a sulphur bath in Burtscheid, which did wonders for my joints. Now I am in Liège, arriving late with a fellow passenger. The journey is tiring, but the spirit is lifted by these encounters with the past.\n\nI think of you and the boys in Berlin. Keep warm.\n\nYour loving husband,\nG.W.F."}}],"created":1795080258,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":196,"prompt_tokens":947,"total_tokens":1143,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-CeSja8piRHAUHxE24BLyHI78r0Yeeql0","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":947,"prompt_ms":976.726,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.031389651531151,"prompt_per_second":969.5656714370255,"predicted_n":196,"predicted_ms":4616.361,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.673646153846153,"predicted_per_second":42.24106390293133}}